	"FriendlyName": "Material-Driven Shadows",
	"Description": "Single-draw-call, instanced blob-shadow system for 10,000+ units. All shadows of one mesh/material pair are batched into a single instanced static mesh; projection, light-direction stretch and ground blending are driven entirely by per-instance custom data in the material.",
